    "markdown": "---\ntitle: \"CoolNet: A Framework for Climate-Adaptive Urban Infrastructure\"\nformat: html\n---\n\n## Project Overview\n\nA spatial decision-support framework for assessing urban microclimates and thermal exposure to identify priority locations for blue-green infrastructure interventions.\n\n## Project Deliverables\n\n### Interactive Spatial Map\n\n\n::: {.cell}\n::: {.cell-output-display}\n\n```{=html}\n<div class=\"leaflet html-widget html-fill-item\" id=\"htmlwidget-2598a17a9bb69d22f579\" style=\"width:100%;height:464px;\"></div>\n<script type=\"application/json\" data-for=\"htmlwidget-2598a17a9bb69d22f579\">{\"x\":{\"options\":{\"crs\":{\"crsClass\":\"L.CRS.EPSG3857\",\"code\":null,\"proj4def\":null,\"projectedBounds\":null,\"options\":{}}},\"calls\":[{\"method\":\"addProviderTiles\",\"args\":[\"CartoDB.Positron\",null,null,{\"errorTileUrl\":\"\",\"noWrap\":false,\"detectRetina\":false}]}],\"setView\":[[55.605,13.0007],12,[]]},\"evals\":[],\"jsHooks\":[]}</script>\n```\n\n:::\n:::\n\n### Presentation Slide Deck\n<iframe src=\"Assets/presentation.pdf\" width=\"100%\" height=\"600px\" style=\"border:none;\"></iframe>\n  [Download Presentation PDF](Assets/presentation.pdf){.btn .btn-primary role=\"button\"}\n",
